  "id": "css-shapes",
  "support": "a",
  "note": "`shape-outside` with `circle()`, `ellipse()`, `inset()`, `polygon()` or a box, and `shape-margin`, wrap lines around a float's shape. Images and gradients are not read, so `shape-image-threshold` does nothing.",
